<title>HONG KONG: Sinocan interim net rises 2.38 percent.</title>
<headline>Sinocan interim net rises 2.38 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.3   vs 11.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    90.22  vs 88.12</p>
<p>    Turnover		     239.32 vs 230.31</p>
<p>    Company name		 Sinocan Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 4-8</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Sinocan Holdings makes cans for the food and beverage industry in China.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
